And I think in that sense , this fits really n@@ ic@@ ely with this lat@@ eral thinking idea .
Here I &apos;m really using the tools of one ac@@ ad@@ emic discipl@@ ine to think about problems of another .
So we think , first and fore@@ most , AIDS is a policy issue .
And probably for most people in this room , that &apos;s how you think about it .
