So we don &apos;t have quite as good data , but you can see here the share of single men having pre@@ -@@ mar@@ ital sex , or mar@@ ried men having extra@@ -@@ mar@@ ital sex , and how that changes from the early &apos; 9@@ 0s to late &apos; 9@@ 0s , and late &apos; 9@@ 0s to early 200@@ 0s . The epidem@@ ic is getting worse .
