So we &apos;re going to need to think about policy and what kind of poli@@ ci@@ es might be effective .
And a great way to learn about policy is to look at what worked in the past .
The reason that we know that the A@@ BC campaig@@ n was effective in U@@ ganda is we have good data on pre@@ val@@ ence over time .
In U@@ ganda we see the pre@@ val@@ ence went down .
