So if I asked you , &quot; Why don &apos;t you go and find me the pre@@ val@@ ence in B@@ ur@@ kin@@ a F@@ as@@ o in 199@@ 1 ? &quot;
You get on Google , you Google , and you find , actually the only people tes@@ ted in B@@ ur@@ kin@@ a F@@ as@@ o in 199@@ 1 are S@@ T@@ D patients and pre@@ g@@ nant women , which is not a terri@@ bly represent@@ ative group of people .
