And when it fin@@ ds one of those ph@@ r@@ ases , it gr@@ ab@@ s the sent@@ ence up to the period , and then autom@@ atic@@ ally tries to de@@ duce the age , g@@ end@@ er and ge@@ ograph@@ ical loc@@ ation of the person that wrote that sent@@ ence .
