And what I &apos;ve tried to do since I had my training as a medical illustr@@ ator -- since I was taught animation by my father , who was a sculp@@ tor and my visual ment@@ or -- I wanted to figure out a way to help people understand truth and beauty in the biological sciences by using animation , by using pictures , by telling stories so that the things that are not necessarily evid@@ ent to people
