So I thought I &apos;d start off by just telling you a little bit about myself and why I lead this sch@@ iz@@ oph@@ ren@@ ic life .
Well , I was born in South Africa and my parents were im@@ pris@@ oned for res@@ is@@ ting the rac@@ ist regi@@ me .
