Well , 80 percent of the men in L@@ es@@ o@@ th@@ o worked in the min@@ es over the bor@@ der , in bru@@ tal conditions .
N@@ ever@@ th@@ eless , I -- as I &apos;m sure -- as a rather ir@@ r@@ it@@ ating young , white man coming into their village , I was wel@@ com@@ ed with incredible hosp@@ it@@ ality and warm@@ th .
