But , in fact , of course , the story is it &apos;s the 70 percent , including the major e-@@ commerce site -- 70 percent of a critical application on which We@@ b@@ -@@ based communic@@ ations and app@@ lications work is produced in this form , in direct competition with Microsoft . Not in a side issue -- in a central strat@@ e@@ gi@@ c decision to try to cap@@ ture a compon@@ ent of the N@@ et .
