to say , this is good . So , this is the O@@ p@@ en Di@@ rec@@ t@@ ory Pro@@ j@@ ect , with 6@@ 0,000 vol@@ un@@ te@@ ers , each one spending a little bit of time , as op@@ posed to a few hundred fully paid emplo@@ ye@@ es . No one ow@@ ns it , no one ow@@ ns the out@@ put , it &apos;s free for anyone to use and it &apos;s the out@@ put of people acting out of social and psycho@@ logical motiv@@ ations to do something interesting .
This is not only outside of bus@@ in@@ esses . When you think of what is the critical innovation of Google , the critical innovation is out@@ sour@@ c@@ ing the one most important thing -- the decision about what &apos;s relev@@ ant -- to the community of the Web as a whole , doing whatever they want to do : so , page r@@ ank .
