It would take millions . But of course , what I &apos;m descri@@ bing is P@@ 2@@ P fi@@ le sh@@ aring .
Right ? We always think of it as ste@@ aling music , but fundament@@ ally , it &apos;s a distribu@@ ted data stor@@ age and re@@ tri@@ ev@@ al system , where people , for very obvious reasons , are willing to share their b@@ and@@ w@@ id@@ th and their stor@@ age to create something .
So , essentially what we &apos;re seeing is the emer@@ gence of a four@@ th trans@@ ac@@ tional fram@@ e@@ work . It used to be that there were two prim@@ ary dimensions along which you could di@@ vide things . They could be market based , or non-@@ market based ; they could be dec@@ entr@@ alized , or centr@@ alized .
The price system was a mark@@ et@@ -@@ based and dec@@ entr@@ alized system .
If things worked better because you actually had somebody organiz@@ ing them , you had fir@@ ms , if you wanted to be in the market -- or you had governments or sometimes larger non-@@ prof@@ its in the non-@@ market .
It was too expensive to have dec@@ entr@@ alized social production , to have dec@@ entr@@ alized action in society . That was not about society itself .
