And the wonderful thing is that super@@ str@@ ing theory has nothing to do at first si@@ ght with this idea of extra dimensions , but when we study super@@ str@@ ing theory , we find that it res@@ ur@@ rec@@ ts the idea in a s@@ par@@ k@@ ling , new form .
So , let me just tell you how that goes .
