I want to arg@@ ue to you that in fact , politics and religion , which are the two prim@@ ary fac@@ tors -- not the so@@ le , but over@@ wh@@ el@@ min@@ g@@ ly , the prim@@ ary fac@@ tors -- which are driving towards a war which looks extremely likely -- bor@@ der@@ ing on the in@@ ev@@ itable at this point , whether one is in fav@@ or of that or not -- that politics and religion are , in fact , themselves better concep@@ tu@@ alized as kinds of technology ,
