What it means to put it mathematic@@ ally is that , if you &apos;re concerned about a society today , you should be looking not at the value of the mathematic@@ al function -- the we@@ alth itself -- but you should be looking at the first der@@ iv@@ ative and the second der@@ iv@@ atives of the function . That &apos;s one general them@@ e . A second general them@@ e is that there are many , often sub@@ tle environmental fac@@ tors that make some soci@@ eties more frag@@ ile than others . Many of those fac@@ tors
