The second question is , What does the blo@@ go@@ sphere actually do for us , in terms of acc@@ essing collective intelligence ?
You know , as Chris menti@@ oned , I wrote a book called &quot; The W@@ is@@ dom of C@@ ro@@ w@@ ds . &quot;
And the pre@@ mise of &quot; The W@@ is@@ dom of C@@ ro@@ w@@ ds &quot; is that , under the right conditions , groups can be remark@@ ably intelligent .
And they can actually often be smar@@ ter than even the smar@@ test person within them .
The simpl@@ est example of this is if you ask a group of people to do something like guess how many j@@ ell@@ y@@ be@@ ans are in a j@@ ar .
If I had a j@@ ar of j@@ ell@@ y@@ be@@ ans and I asked you all to guess how many j@@ ell@@ y@@ be@@ ans were in that j@@ ar , your average guess would be remark@@ ably good .
