And what &apos;s fascin@@ ating is that you can see this phenomenon at work in many more complicated situations .
For instance , if you look at the od@@ ds on hor@@ ses at a rac@@ e@@ track , they predic@@ t almost perfectly how likely a hor@@ se is to win .
In a sense , the group of bet@@ ters at the rac@@ e@@ track is fo@@ rec@@ as@@ ting the future , in probabil@@ istic terms .
