Now , this has all these bene@@ fits : it &apos;s very bene@@ fici@@ al in terms of the effici@@ ency of communic@@ ating information ; it gives you access to a whole ho@@ st of people ; it allows people to co@@ ordin@@ ate their acti@@ vi@@ ties in very good ways .
But the problem is that groups are only smart when the people in them are as in@@ dependent as possible .
