And that phenomenon of pil@@ ing on the exis@@ ting lin@@ ks is one that is char@@ acter@@ istic of the blo@@ go@@ sphere , particularly of the political blo@@ go@@ sphere , and it is one that essentially thro@@ ws off this beautiful , dec@@ entr@@ alized , bot@@ tom@@ -up intelligence that blogs can manif@@ est in the right conditions .
The metap@@ h@@ or that I like to use is the metap@@ h@@ or of the circul@@ ar mil@@ l .
