What I thought I would talk about today is the transition from one mode of thinking about nature to another that &apos;s tr@@ acked by architecture .
What &apos;s interesting about archit@@ ects is , we always have tried to jus@@ ti@@ fy beauty by looking to nature , and argu@@ ably , beautiful architecture has always been looking at a model of nature .
