So , what I thought I would bring up is another compon@@ ent that needs to be thought of , wh@@ en@@ ever you think about nature , and that &apos;s basically the invention of gener@@ ic form in genetic evolution .
My her@@ o is actually not Darwin ; it &apos;s a guy named Willi@@ am B@@ at@@ es@@ on , father of Gre@@ g B@@ at@@ es@@ on , who was here for a long time in Mon@@ ter@@ ey .
