The second one is the lab@@ or poli@@ ci@@ es that we have , which make it so difficult for entrepreneurs to create stand@@ ar@@ di@@ zed jobs in companies , that 9@@ 3 percent of Indian lab@@ or is in the un@@ organiz@@ ed sec@@ tor .
They have no bene@@ fits : they don &apos;t have social security ; they don &apos;t have pen@@ sion ; they don &apos;t have health@@ care ; none of those things .
