But most important I believe are the ideas we need to anti@@ cip@@ ate .
Here India can look at what is happening in the west and el@@ se@@ where , and look at what needs to be done .
The first thing is , we &apos;re very for@@ tun@@ ate that technology is at a point where it is much more adv@@ anced than when other countries had the development .
