C@@ lear@@ ly , we &apos;re living in a moment of crisis .
Ar@@ gu@@ ably the financial markets have failed us and the aid system is fai@@ ling us , and yet I stand fir@@ m@@ ly with the optimis@@ ts who believe that there has probably never been a more exciting moment to be alive .
Because of some of technologies we &apos;ve been talking about .
