But images don &apos;t need to be graphi@@ c in order to re@@ mind us of the tr@@ age@@ dy of war .
John Moore set up this photo at Ar@@ l@@ ington C@@ em@@ et@@ ery .
After all the ten@@ se moments of conflict in all the conflict zones of the world , there &apos;s one photograph from a much qui@@ eter place that hau@@ n@@ ts me still , much more than the others .
