Now , this exhi@@ bi@@ tion , as I said , 40 young artists done over the course of eight years , and for me it &apos;s about consi@@ der@@ ing the imp@@ lications .
It &apos;s consi@@ der@@ ing the imp@@ lications of what this generation has to say to the rest of us .
