So the last iter@@ ation of this project has been called F@@ low , with the idea now of creating a real network of artists around the world ; really looking , not so much from Har@@ lem and out , but looking across , and F@@ low looked at artists all born on the continent of Africa .
And as many of us think about that continent and think about what if means to us all in the 21@@ st century , I have beg@@ un that looking through artists , through art@@ works , and imagin@@ ing what they can tell us about the future , what they tell us about our future , and what they create in their sense of off@@ ering us this great possibility of watching that continent emer@@ ge as part of our bigger di@@ alo@@ gue .
So , what do I discover when I look at art@@ works ?
