I took this picture because this turns out to be the first coff@@ e@@ e@@ house to open in Engl@@ and in 16@@ 50 .
That &apos;s its great cl@@ aim to f@@ ame , and I wanted to show it to you , not because I want to give you the kind of St@@ ar@@ buc@@ ks tour of histor@@ ic Engl@@ and , but rather because the English coff@@ e@@ e@@ house was cruci@@ al to the development and spread of one of the great intellectu@@ al flo@@ wer@@ ings of the last 500 years , what we now call the En@@ ligh@@ ten@@ ment .
And the coff@@ e@@ e@@ house played such a big role in the birth of the En@@ ligh@@ ten@@ ment , in part , because of what people were dr@@ in@@ king there .
