kind of sig@@ nature behavior that shows up again and again in all of these environ@@ ments .
Are there rec@@ ur@@ ring patterns that we can learn from , that we can take and kind of ap@@ ply to our own lives , or our own organizations , or our own environ@@ ments to make them more creative and innov@@ ative ?
